This distribution includes DeepSeek Harness packaging, installation, continuous
integration, and documentation changes: the DSH skill manifest
(dsh/manifest.json), the install / doctor / uninstall manager
(scripts/dsh_manager.py), the packaging tests (tests/test_dsh_package.py), the
install-dsh.ps1 and install-dsh.sh entry points, the Checks workflow
(.github/workflows/checks.yml), and the DeepSeek Harness guide
(docs/deepseek-harness.md). Third-party audio and source attributions remain in
assets/audio/ATTRIBUTION.md and references/shots/ATTRIBUTION.md.
